KEY CONCEPTS AND ENTITIES
==========================
- User: Entity with a clearance level; may have roles assigned or delegated.
- Administrator: User with administrative role and high clearance.
- Role: Set of permissions; can be assigned or delegated; some roles are mutually exclusive.
- Clearance Level: Security clearance of a user (High, Medium, Low).
